Package: SparsityAwareCATE
Type: Package
Title: Sparsity- and Homogeneity-Aware Estimation of Group-Specific CATEs
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Xin", "Ye", role = "aut"),
    person("You-Gan", "Wang", email = "you-gan.wang@uq.edu.au", role = c("aut", "cre"))
    )
Description: Implements penalized R-learning methods for group-specific conditional
    average treatment effects with simultaneous group-specific sparsity and global
    cross-group homogeneity recovery. The package includes cross-fitted nuisance
    estimation, optional heteroscedasticity-motivated loss weights, an ADMM solver,
    local and pooled comparison estimators, structured post-selection inference,
    simulation utilities, and the code used in the associated manuscript.
License: GPL-3
Encoding: UTF-8
